      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement the extract_text.py file that extracts plain text from a scanned document image, I will use the Amazon Textract service, which is a powerful OCR (Optical Character Recognition) service provided by AWS. The code will import the necessary AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) and use the Textract client to call the appropriate API. The provider will be identifiable by the import of the Boto3 library and the use of the Textract client. </thinking>\n",
